    <<case `C.npc.Tsukihan.dom gte 70`>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          Tsukihan leans back against the wooden pillar, <<his>> chest heaving with ragged breaths and a flushed, triumphant smile on <<his>> face.
          <<He>> reaches out with one hand and tugs your wrist, pulling you down against <<his>> warmth.
          "Did you think I would let you get up so quickly? You distracted me from my duties today... so you're staying right here until my breath comes back."
        <<option 'CN'>>
          月羽靠在木柱上急促地喘息着，微红的脸上带着几分得逞与满足的笑意。
          <<He>>伸手拉住你的手腕，顺势将你拉到自己温热的怀里。
          “以为这就结束了？今天是你先让我分心的……在我缓过气之前，哪儿也别想去，就在这儿陪着我。”
