    <<case `C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lte 30`>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          Tsukihan curls up on the tatami, hiding <<his>> burning face behind the sleeve of <<his>> inner robe as <<his>> body trembles through the aftershocks.
